# Play test of Dunecrown Isle (CIPlay dunecrown_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: across the plaza and up the
# great pyramid's stair to the king's chest, into the tomb past its rats, the oasis and the caravan's tents, the barrel
# on the black ridge, the wreck's barrel, the buried tins. Points as in its recipe.
island Dunecrown Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Hyena 3
expect animals Rat 2
expect animals Screecher 1
wait 5
where BalboaCave
kill Hyena
walk 0 -27 to 0 -23 h=5.5
read Stone at the stair
walk 0 -20 to 0 -12 to 0 -4 to 0 4 to 0 7 to 1.4 9 to 1.4 11 to 0 13 h=19
expect stand 0 13 h=19 below=21
open The king's chest
kill Rat
walk 34 -4 to 34 -9 to 34 -14 to 35 -17 h=4.1 below=7
expect stand 35 -17 h=4 below=7
read Tomb tablet
open Sealed coffer
walk -26 -48 to -28 -44 h=1.3
read The caravan master's ledger
open Caravan chest
kill Screecher
open Barrel on the ridge
open Barrel by the wreck
expect hidden vinechest
dig
expect animals Hyena 0
expect animals Rat 0
